OL,3,GNEWSAPost Office closure 'devastating
OL,4,Ablow'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey Post Office is the latest to
OL,7,Fshut its doors as 52 close across the
OL,8,Fcountry.
OL,10,FBurpham Post Office will close on
OL,11,FSaturday, a move that local councillor
OL,12,FGeorge Potter has labelled a "blow to
OL,13,Fthe community".
OL,15,FThe closing Post Office stores are run
OL,16,Fby Morrisons, which blames the closures
OL,17,Fon rising costs.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
