OL,3,GNEWSAPost Office closure 'devastating
OL,4,Ablow'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Post Office said it was not its
OL,7,Fdecision to close the branches and it
OL,8,Fwas "working hard to find solutions as
OL,9,Fquickly as possible as we fully
OL,10,Frecognise the inconvenience this will
OL,11,Fcause our customers".
